---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Our Approach" description="Great care starts with a doctor who knows you.">

<section class="hero-subpage">
    <div class="hero-bg" style="background-image: url('/assets/images/orchard-peaches.jpg'); background-position: center 25%;"></div>
    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <span class="hero-eyebrow">Our approach</span>
      <h1 class="hero-headline">For us, you're never<br>just another patient.</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">Healthcare is built around appointments, Foundation is built around you.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

<section class="section-ivory" style="padding: var(--s-12) 0;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split fade-up">
      <div class="split-image">
        <img src="/assets/images/child-arm-bandaids.jpg" alt="Foundation Clinic approach" />
      </div>
      <div class="split-content">
        <div class="who-we-are-content fade-up">
  <span class="eyebrow">Our approach</span>
  <div class="approach-steps">
          <div class="approach-step">
            <span class="approach-num">01</span>
            <div>
              <h3>We get to know you.</h3>
              <p>We collect all your medical history into one longitudinal health record. Every professional you meet through us is fully informed of all essential details.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="approach-step">
            <span class="approach-num">02</span>
            <div>
              <h3>We see the big picture.</h3>
              <p>We create a long-term health plan that supports you through different stages of life, and coordinate all your care across specialists.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="approach-step">
            <span class="approach-num">03</span>
            <div>
              <h3>We keep you in the loop.</h3>
              <p>Your care team stays ahead of your health, reaching out when it's time for a check-up, tests, or other appointments. You and your loved ones always know what's next.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-cream" id="coordinated-care" style="padding: 0; padding-top: var(--s-20);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split fade-up">
      <div class="split-content">
        <span class="eyebrow">Our services</span>
        <h2>Small details or the big picture - we take care of both.</h2>
        <p>Your doctor connects the dots so you don't have to repeat yourself, chase your results, or navigate the system alone.</p>
      <a href="/en/our-services" class="btn btn-ghost" style="margin-top: 8px;">→</a>
      </div>

      <div style="padding: 40px 0; font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',system-ui,sans-serif;">

        <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px;">
          <div style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E7DCCD;border-radius:999px;padding:9px 22px;font-size:12px;color:#2E1F14;font-weight:500;">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#9B8775" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 20c0-4 3.6-7 8-7s8 3 8 7"/></svg>
            You
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="width:1px;height:24px;background:#E7DCCD;margin:0 auto;"></div>

        <div style="background:#F6ECDD;border:1px solid #E7DCCD;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 20px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#5A3E2B" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;"><path d="M4.8 2.3A.3.3 0 1 0 5 2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v5a6 6 0 0 0 6 6v0a6 6 0 0 0 6-6V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-1a.2.2 0 1 0 .3.3"/><path d="M8 15v1a6 6 0 0 0 6 6v0a6 6 0 0 0 6-6v-4"/><circle cx="20" cy="10" r="2"/></svg>
          <div>
            <div style="font-family:'Belleza',Georgia,serif;font-size:14px;color:#2E1F14;margin-bottom:2px;">Your Foundation doctor</div>
            <div style="font-size:10px;color:#9B8775;">Single point of contact</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <svg width="100%" height="56" viewBox="0 0 480 56" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet" aria-hidden="true" style="display:block;">
          <defs>
            <marker id="dn" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto"><path d="M2 1L8 5L2 9" fill="none" stroke="#C9BBA9" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></marker>
            <marker id="up" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8" refY="5" markerWidth="5" markerHeight="5" orient="auto"><path d="M2 1L8 5L2 9" fill="none" stroke="#9B8775" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></marker>
          </defs>
          <line x1="240" y1="0" x2="60"  y2="0" stroke="#C9BBA9" stroke-width="1"/>
          <line x1="240" y1="0" x2="420" y2="0" stroke="#C9BBA9" stroke-width="1"/>
          <line x1="60"  y1="0" x2="60"  y2="46" stroke="#C9BBA9" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#dn)"/>
          <line x1="180" y1="0" x2="180" y2="46" stroke="#C9BBA9" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#dn)"/>
          <line x1="300" y1="0" x2="300" y2="46" stroke="#C9BBA9" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#dn)"/>
          <line x1="420" y1="0" x2="420" y2="46" stroke="#C9BBA9" stroke-width="1" marker-end="url(#dn)"/>
          <line x1="192" y1="46" x2="192" y2="6" stroke="#9B8775" stroke-width="0.75" stroke-dasharray="3 2" marker-end="url(#up)"/>
          <line x1="312" y1="46" x2="312" y2="6" stroke="#9B8775" stroke-width="0.75" stroke-dasharray="3 2" marker-end="url(#up)"/>
        </svg>

        <div class="approach-services-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:8px;align-items:stretch;">
          <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E7DCCD;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2E1F14" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2"/><rect x="9" y="3" width="6" height="4" rx="2"/><path d="M9 12h6M9 16h4"/></svg>
            <div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:#C9BBA9;">01</div>
            <div style="font-family:'Belleza',Georgia,serif;font-size:11px;color:#2E1F14;line-height:1.3;">Health Planning</div>
            <div style="font-size:10px;color:#9B8775;line-height:1.6;flex:1;">Comprehensive doctor-led health assessment with extensive labs. Personalised plan built around you.</div>
          </div>
          <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E7DCCD;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2E1F14" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
            <div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:#C9BBA9;">02</div>
            <div style="font-family:'Belleza',Georgia,serif;font-size:11px;color:#2E1F14;line-height:1.3;">Care Coordination</div>
            <div style="font-size:10px;color:#9B8775;line-height:1.6;flex:1;">Specialist briefed and appointments scheduled on your behalf. One consolidated invoice per month.</div>
          </div>
          <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E7DCCD;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2E1F14" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M2 12h20M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z"/></svg>
            <div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:#C9BBA9;">03</div>
            <div style="font-family:'Belleza',Georgia,serif;font-size:11px;color:#2E1F14;line-height:1.3;">Care Abroad</div>
            <div style="font-size:10px;color:#9B8775;line-height:1.6;flex:1;">We contact local specialists, coordinate your care, and issue prescriptions abroad.</div>
          </div>
          <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E7DCCD;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2E1F14" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z"/></svg>
            <div style="font-size:9px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:#C9BBA9;">04</div>
            <div style="font-family:'Belleza',Georgia,serif;font-size:11px;color:#2E1F14;line-height:1.3;">Acute Care</div>
            <div style="font-size:10px;color:#9B8775;line-height:1.6;flex:1;">Everything from urgent needs to health-related questions handled by your own doctor.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:14px;font-size:10px;color:#C9BBA9;text-align:center;">All findings and results return to your doctor.</div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-ivory" id="our-network">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split fade-up" id="our-network-split">
      <div class="network-inner" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: var(--s-6); align-items: start;">
        <div class="split-image network-portrait" style="margin: 0;">
          <img src="/assets/images/london-thames-dusk.jpg" alt="Global care network" style="aspect-ratio: 3/5; object-fit: cover; width: 100%;" />
        </div>
        <div class="partners-list" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--s-8); padding-top: var(--s-2);">
          <div>
            <div style="font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--fg-4); margin-bottom: var(--s-3);">Selected partners abroad</div>
            <div style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--fg-3); line-height: 2;">
              The Mayo Clinic<br>MD Anderson<br>Harvard University<br>Stanford University<br>Karolinska Universitetssjukhuset<br>Universitätskliniken Tübingen
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div style="font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--fg-4); margin-bottom: var(--s-3);">Selected partners in Finland</div>
            <div style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--fg-3); line-height: 2;">
              Helsinki University Hospital<br>Kuopio University Hospital<br>Pihlajalinna · Mehiläinen<br>Terveystalo · Aava &amp; Pikkujätti<br>Ihosairaala · Spider Med<br>Painoklinikka · Saraste Klinikka
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="split-content">
        <span class="eyebrow">Care Abroad</span>
        <h2>Highest quality of care, no matter where you live or travel.</h2>
        <p>Thanks to our global network, you don't have to live in Finland to become our client. We write prescriptions, refer you to acute or specialist care when needed, and help you navigate the local healthcare system.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 16px;">We collaborate with your local doctor and health insurance companies to ensure your care runs as smoothly as possible.</p>
        <a href="/en/care-abroad" class="btn btn-ghost" style="margin-top: 28px;">→</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-cream" id="medical-data">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split fade-up">
      <div class="split-content">
        <span class="eyebrow">Your health data</span>
        <h2>Your whole history in one place.</h2>
        <p>We bring all your data together into one continuous health record, regardless of where you have been receiving care.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 16px;">This longitudinal view allows your doctor to spot patterns, act early, and make decisions that are truly informed by your full story.</p>
        <a href="/en/your-data" class="btn btn-ghost" style="margin-top: 24px;">→</a>
      </div>
      <div class="split-image">
        <img src="/assets/images/dashboard_3.png" alt="Medical data" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;object-position:center;background:#fff;" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-fullbleed-image" style="min-height: 560px; padding: var(--s-24) 0;">
  <div class="fullbleed-bg" style="background-image: url('/assets/images/tennis-clay.jpg'); background-position: 90% 60% !important; background-size: cover !important;"></div>
  <div class="fullbleed-overlay"></div>
  <div class="fullbleed-content">
    <div style="max-width: 520px;">
      <span class="eyebrow" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);">Memberships</span>
      <h2 style="color: #FDF6EE;">In it for the long term.</h2>
      <p style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);">Our membership model allows easy access to your doctor, data-driven prevention, and seamless coordination of care.</p>
      <a href="/en/memberships" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top: 32px; display: inline-block; background: #1C1410;">Join Foundation</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</Base>